WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.270
- So we have more details

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:03.400
about what is happening to Joel Greenberg.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.380
In the Northern District of Florida.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:06.640
As was expected,

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.670
he has signed a cooperation
deal with federal prosecutors.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.760
Number one, he is pleading guilty to six

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.210
of the 33 counts that he was charged with.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.330
He's admitting that he's paid over $70,000

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.570
for over 150 sex acts, that he
has defrauded the government,

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:22.620
that he has stolen money from
taxpayers in Northern Florida.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.550
And perhaps most
importantly, he has agreed

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.580
to cooperate with federal prosecutors.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.640
And of course the papers themselves

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.570
don't name Matt Gates by name,
but one has to wonder why

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.980
would federal prosecutors
sign a cooperation agreement

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:38.260
if he wasn't agreeing to cooperate
against someone higher up

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.093
in the food chain?

00:00:39.093 --> 00:00:41.710
And really all roads
point to Matt Gates here.

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:42.543
So in all likelihood,

00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:44.753
we will probably see Matt Gates in court.

